00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:14.800
Even the military uniforms similar between,&nbsp;
you know, the Castro green uniform and Hugo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:20.480
Chavez and Nicolas Maduro in Venezuela appearing&nbsp;
sometimes and, you know, essentially military&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:28.160
dress uniforms. And it's sort of disturbing to&nbsp;
me that supposed progressives not only fall for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:35.040
the faux populist rhetoric, but they even fall for&nbsp;
like even the military uniform stuff doesn't raise&nbsp;&nbsp;

