alarms to you. The suspicion that these folks have&nbsp;
of the military uniform when it's the U.S. or the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:49.360
U.K. military seems to go out the window. When you&nbsp;
see the same sort of stuff being done in Cuba and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:54.720
